fferent management problem, and it's the problem Kubernetes was built for.\n\n*[cross-bearing: see Ch 2 §1 — the architectural container-versus-VM contrast]*\n\n### What Kubernetes provides","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
